<slide xmlns="https://www.larkoffice.com/sml/2.0"><style><fill><fillColor color="rgb(250,245,240)"/></fill></style><data><shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="34" width="864" height="52"><content textType="body" fontSize="30" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" wrap="false"><p>一个模型的后半生：被冷落、被批评、被命名</p></content></shape><line startX="90" startY="250" endX="870" endY="250"><border color="rgb(160,110,105)" width="3"/></line><shape type="ellipse" topLeftX="81" topLeftY="241" width="18" height="18"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(210,90,86)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="16" topLeftY="196" width="148" height="40"><content textType="body" fontSize="26" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" bold="true" textAlign="center" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" wrap="false"><p>1838</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="16" topLeftY="272" width="148" height="104"><content textType="body" fontSize="18" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(115,95,95)" textAlign="center" verticalAlign="top" lineSpacing="multiple:1.25"><p>出版，同时代人读不懂其中的数学</p></content></shape><shape type="ellipse" topLeftX="237" topLeftY="241" width="18" height="18"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(210,90,86)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="172" topLeftY="196" width="148" height="40"><content textType="body" fontSize="26" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" bold="true" textAlign="center" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" wrap="false"><p>1883</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="172" topLeftY="272" width="148" height="104"><content textType="body" fontSize="18" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(115,95,95)" textAlign="center" verticalAlign="top" lineSpacing="multiple:1.25"><p>伯特兰发表批评性书评</p></content></shape><shape type="ellipse" topLeftX="393" topLeftY="241" width="18" height="18"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(210,90,86)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="328" topLeftY="196" width="148" height="40"><content textType="body" fontSize="26" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" bold="true" textAlign="center" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" wrap="false"><p>1897</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="328" topLeftY="272" width="148" height="104"><content textType="body" fontSize="18" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(115,95,95)" textAlign="center" verticalAlign="top" lineSpacing="multiple:1.25"><p>英译本出版，费雪编制文献目录</p></content></shape><shape type="ellipse" topLeftX="549" topLeftY="241" width="18" height="18"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(210,90,86)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="484" topLeftY="196" width="148" height="40"><content textType="body" fontSize="26" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" bold="true" textAlign="center" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" wrap="false"><p>1929</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="484" topLeftY="272" width="148" height="104"><content textType="body" fontSize="18" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(115,95,95)" textAlign="center" verticalAlign="top" lineSpacing="multiple:1.25"><p>霍特林改造；1934 年斯塔克尔伯格提出领导者模型</p></content></shape><shape type="ellipse" topLeftX="705" topLeftY="241" width="18" height="18"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(210,90,86)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="640" topLeftY="196" width="148" height="40"><content textType="body" fontSize="26" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" bold="true" textAlign="center" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" wrap="false"><p>1950</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="640" topLeftY="272" width="148" height="104"><content textType="body" fontSize="18" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(115,95,95)" textAlign="center" verticalAlign="top" lineSpacing="multiple:1.25"><p>纳什：古诺均衡是纳什均衡的特例</p></content></shape><shape type="ellipse" topLeftX="861" topLeftY="241" width="18" height="18"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(210,90,86)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="796" topLeftY="196" width="148" height="40"><content textType="body" fontSize="26" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" bold="true" textAlign="center" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" wrap="false"><p>1960s</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="796" topLeftY="272" width="148" height="104"><content textType="body" fontSize="18" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(115,95,95)" textAlign="center" verticalAlign="top" lineSpacing="multiple:1.25"><p>实验经济学在实验室里检验古诺与伯特兰</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="396" width="864" height="70"><content textType="body" fontSize="22" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(210,90,86)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3"><p>知识生成不等于“提出那一刻就被承认”：出版、批评、转译、再命名，都是创造的一部分。</p></content></shape></data><note><content textType="body" fontSize="14"><p><!-- citation: [5][6][9][10][11] --></p><p>这本 1838 年的书在古诺生前几乎没有反响，他在 1863 年用通俗语言重写了一遍，仍然没有引起重视。</p><p>真正的转机来自三件事：1883 年伯特兰的批评性书评，1897 年的英译本，以及二十世纪博弈论的重新表述。</p><p>可以让学生讨论：如果一项成果要等几十年才被理解，作者、同行和教科书各起了什么作用？</p></content></note></slide>